# Real legal documents and their transcripts never enter version control.
# Allow-list, not a block-list: a new file type must be added deliberately
# rather than inheriting an exemption someone wrote for something else.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Sub-directories are where documents actually land, so they stay ignored —
# but their README must be committed, or a fresh clone has a drop folder with
# no instructions and no statement of the de-identification requirement.
# READMEs ONLY. Nothing here re-admits a document.
!*/
*/*
!*/README.md
